  "description": "Codex: Orks (11e) HIT 'EM HARDER through the real stratagem WINDOW on the Orks' own turn (design .llm/ork_codex_11e_design.md §3). Fixture ork11e_orks_active: P1 Orks (War Horde, 6 CP) active vs P2 Custodes; Boyz B (+ attached Warboss) engaged with Custodian Guard A. Both Pile In halves are passed (setup, committed precedent), then the player clicks the Boyz in the right-panel fighter picker. Selecting the unit opens the unit_selected_to_fight window: the StratagemDialog must appear with the HIT 'EM HARDER card and an ENABLED 'Use on Boyz' button, the S panel route stays closed, and every other phase action is refused while it waits. A real click on Use spends 1 CP, puts melee [LETHAL HITS] on the Boyz AND the attached Warboss, and resumes the activation (attack assignment dialog). The fight is then resolved through the attack dialog + resolution dock and the melee wound dice must report lethal_hits_weapon. Setup-only privileges: auto wound allocation for the Custodes defender, Custodian Guard A wounds inflated so the unit survives.",
